  "does raising the temperature make the model's answers more accurate?|k=8|lectures=": {
   "answer": "No, raising the temperature does not add knowledge or truth, and it is an anti-pattern to treat temperature as a truth dial [L02 slide 59, L02 slide 54]. Temperature only rescales logits and changes selection probabilities or concentration, while evaluation determines usefulness [L02 slide 14, L02 slide 54].",
